Module world_ambitions "What a power is after, and how it goes about it, a stage at a time" {
  Kind ambition.
  // A power pursues an ambition in stages, the next due so many watches after the last (its pace), while the power
  // is able and the ambition is neither won nor foiled. What each stage does is the ambition's author's: rules on
  // stage(ambition), and on won and foiled.
  Relation pursues(group, ambition). Relation won(ambition). Relation foiled(ambition).
  Measure stage(ambition). Measure stageDue(ambition). Measure pace(ambition).
  Rule ambition_advances when pursues(?g, ?a) and able(?g) and not won(?a) and not foiled(?a)
    and watch(clock) >= stageDue(?a) { Increase stage(?a) by 1. Increase stageDue(?a) by pace(?a). }
  Goal false.
}
